{
  "name": "CounterOffensive_INTRO",
  "script": [
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "zexal_barian",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Meanwhile in Barian World."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "dumon",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "barian_neutral",
      "text": "Our plan was to give power to the humans so that they would steal Numbers and destroy Astral World."
    },
    {
      "char": "dumon",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "barian_neutral",
      "text": "Unfortunately, Vetrix and Faker were both defeated by the power of ZEXAL."
    },
    {
      "char": "dumon",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "barian_neutral",
      "text": "Therefore, we will destroy Astral World ourselves."
    },
    {
      "char": "alito",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "barian_neutral",
      "text": "But Barian World and Astral World are both meta-energy worlds. We cannot attack them directly."
    },
    {
      "char": "girag",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "barian_neutral",
      "text": "In their world, we cannot appear in our natural form. We must disguise ourselves as – ick – humans."
    },
    {
      "char": "dumon",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "barian_win",
      "text": "We have no choice. We need those Numbers."
    },
    {
      "char": "dumon",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "barian_neutral",
      "text": "Girag, you go."
    },
    {
      "char": "girag",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "barian_lose",
      "text": "Me?"
    },
    {
      "char": "dumon",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "barian_neutral",
      "text": "You are a brave Barian warrior. I know you can do the job."
    },
    {
      "char": "girag",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "barian_neutral",
      "text": "Yes. I am a brave warrior. Strong too!"
    },
    {
      "char": "girag",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "barian_neutral",
      "text": "I will get every single Number. Do not worry, Dumon."
    },
    {
      "char": "dumon",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "barian_neutral",
      "text": "I am counting on you, Girag."
    },
    {
      "char": "girag",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "dumon",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "alito",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "zexal_city_day",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Back on Earth, Yuma met a new student."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "rayshadows",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Whoa! I know you! You're Yuma, the World Duel Carnival champion."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "rayshadows",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Boy am I glad I ran into you!"
    },
    {
      "char": "rayshadows",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "My name’s Ray! I’m a huge fan of yours."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "I’d love to stay and talk about me, but I gotta make it to school!"
    },
    {
      "char": "rayshadows",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I wouldn’t want you to be late! I’ll get you to class on time. We’ll go the “Ray Way!” That means shortcuts galore!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Like through that junkyard with snarling rabid dogs? AHHHH!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "rayshadows",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "zexal_school",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "reginaldkastle",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Meanwhile, Shark's sister Rio finally woke up from her coma and returned to school."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "rio",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Reginald, I thought we would walk to school together!"
    },
    {
      "char": "rio",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "What are you, too cool to be seen with your younger sister?"
    },
    {
      "char": "reginaldkastle",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Great to see you back on your feet, Rio!"
    },
    {
      "char": "rio",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "It’s so nice to meet some friendly faces! What a great start to my first day of class."
    },
    {
      "char": "reginaldkastle",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "rio",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Then the Barians, Alito and Girag, appeared in their human forms."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "girag",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "The school quickly turned dangerous when Girag attacked Yuma."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "girag",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "girag",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "I am Girag, a Barian warrior. And you are going down, twerp!"
    },
    {
      "char": "girag",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "alito",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Suddenly, Alito appeared and saved Yuma."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "girag",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Why are you helping him!?"
    },
    {
      "char": "alito",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "That's my business!"
    },
    {
      "char": "girag",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "You traitor!"
    },
    {
      "char": "girag",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "We need that kid's Numbers to save our world!"
    },
    {
      "char": "alito",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Yeah, I’m aware of that."
    },
    {
      "char": "alito",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "But I want to beat Yuma and Astral by myself! Not you – me!"
    },
    {
      "char": "girag",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "RRRRR!"
    },
    {
      "char": "girag",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "alito",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Hold up. If I accept, I'm going to have to put my Numbers on the line, right?"
    },
    {
      "char": "alito",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Of course. We'll both be dueling for Numbers and our very survival."
    },
    {
      "char": "alito",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I'm willing to risk everything to duel against you. I'll beat both you AND Astral!"
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "If you're so eager to battle us, then bring it on! We're ready!"
    },
    {
      "char": "alito",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I activate a Barian Sphere Field!"
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "PROP_ON",
      "image": "zexal_bariansspherecube",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "alito",
      "pos": "FADEOUT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "alito",
      "pos": "RIGHT:FADEIN",
      "image": "barian_neutral",
      "text": "Let us duel!"
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "PROP_OFF",
      "image": "zexal_bariansspherecube",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "astral",
      "pos": "FADEOUT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "FADEOUT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "zexal",
      "pos": "LEFT:FADEIN",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Let's duel!"
    }
  ]
}
